    "request": "ep1-zhaovillage-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-zhaovillage-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "師父臨終前，把家傳的青釭劍交到他手上：「劍快，是末技；肯等，才是守門人。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "zhaovillage",
