    "request": "ep1-prologue-s06",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-prologue-s06.png",
    "sourceBeat": "而在人潮的另一頭，還有兩個逆流而行的身影——他們還不知道，彼此會在今夜相遇。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 1,
    "kind": "pan",
    "localTime": 4,
    "episodeTime": 184,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s01",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "關下的流民營，亂得像一鍋沸水。灰旗兵驅趕人群，鞭子落在跑不動的老人身上。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 32,
    "episodeTime": 212,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「灑家的寺可以燒，人不能跪。要押走他們，先從灑家身上踏過去。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "push",
    "localTime": 44,
    "episodeTime": 224,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "灰旗兵層層圍上。人群裡又殺出一對日月雙刀——獨龍岡的扈三娘。她追著押走全家的囚車走了三日三夜，追到關前，囚車還是進了關。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 58,
    "episodeTime": 238,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「我家的門，是被這道關拆的。拆門的人，一個都別想全身走。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 5,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 68,
    "episodeTime": 248,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s05",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s05.png",
    "sourceBeat": "亂軍之中，三件兵器第一次碰在一起：劍護著老人，杖擋著箭雨，雙刀開路。三扇被拆的家門——焚了的寺、追不上的囚車、名冊上排第一的名字——在刀光裡認出了彼此。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 6,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 80,
    "episodeTime": 260,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s06",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s06.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「原來不是只有我一個，不肯讓門就這樣關上。兩位——同路嗎？」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "oath",
    "shotIndex": 7,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 92,
    "episodeTime": 272,
    "request": "ep1-oath-s07",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-oath-s07.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「同路。不入帝都，誓不下山。」"
  },
  {
