    "sourceBeat": "滄嵐山的雲階，一級一級，走向被咒的將軍。鐵僧攔路，鐘聲當盾。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "clouds",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 24.5,
    "episodeTime": 809.5,
    "request": "ep1-clouds-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-clouds-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「同是出家人，你的鐘渡不了他。讓我的杖試試。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "clouds",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 44,
    "episodeTime": 829,
    "request": "ep1-clouds-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-clouds-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "雲裡落石，風裡藏刀。走一步，還一步。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "clouds",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "pan",
    "localTime": 62,
    "episodeTime": 847,
    "request": "ep1-clouds-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-clouds-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "雲階盡頭，一把方天畫戟插在石裡——戟的主人，眼睛是灰色的。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "lubu",
    "shotIndex": 1,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 4,
    "episodeTime": 874,
    "request": "ep1-lubu-s01",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-lubu-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「灰帝的詛咒餵著我的戟。要斷咒，先斷我——來。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "lubu",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "fight",
    "localTime": 26,
    "episodeTime": 896,
    "request": "ep1-lubu-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-lubu-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "戟風過處，雲都退了三尺。趙雲的劍快，呂布的戟更快。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "lubu",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "fight",
    "localTime": 46,
    "episodeTime": 916,
    "request": "ep1-lubu-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-lubu-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "三娘的紅纓纏戟，魯智深的禪杖壓肩——三件兵器，織成一張網。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "lubu",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 66,
    "episodeTime": 936,
    "request": "ep1-lubu-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-lubu-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "網收緊的一刻，青釭劍點在戟主的眉心：不是殺，是斬咒。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "lubu",
    "shotIndex": 5,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 82,
    "episodeTime": 952,
    "request": "ep1-lubu-s05",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-lubu-s05.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「……灰色散了。此刃，重歸於我。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "freed",
    "shotIndex": 1,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 4,
    "episodeTime": 969,
    "request": "ep1-freed-s01",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-freed-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「詛咒已斷，我的戟自己作主。天脈城一戰——算我一份。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "freed",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 18,
    "episodeTime": 983,
    "request": "ep1-freed-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-freed-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「在咒裡的十年，我看過他的真身——前朝一個史官，一支筆。寫下的約會自己行走，這就是詔令。而被墨改寫的人沒有死——他們被寫進了，別的書頁。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "freed",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 40,
    "episodeTime": 1005,
    "request": "ep1-freed-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-freed-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "眾人抬頭。血月懸在城上，像一隻不肯眨的眼——原來那不是天象，是他的硯。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "freed",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 58,
    "episodeTime": 1023,
    "request": "ep1-freed-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-freed-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「那就打翻它。墨再深，也深不過寫它的人心。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "freed",
    "shotIndex": 5,
    "kind": "pan",
    "localTime": 70,
    "episodeTime": 1035,
    "request": "ep1-freed-s05",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-freed-s05.png",
    "sourceBeat": "飛將軍並轡而行。雲開處，帝都已經看得見了。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "bloodmoon",
    "shotIndex": 1,
    "kind": "pan",
    "localTime": 4,
    "episodeTime": 1049,
    "request": "ep1-bloodmoon-s01",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-bloodmoon-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "天脈城在血月下開著門——灰帝知道他們來了，氣漩沿著城牆唱歌。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "bloodmoon",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 24,
    "episodeTime": 1069,
    "request": "ep1-bloodmoon-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-bloodmoon-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「那就讓他看我們走進去。他毀掉的每一個誓，都在月亮這一邊等著。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "bloodmoon",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "fight",
    "localTime": 44,
    "episodeTime": 1089,
    "request": "ep1-bloodmoon-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-bloodmoon-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "玉衛列陣，供奉結印。牌局一場接一場——讀招者生，硬拼者死。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "bloodmoon",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "push",
    "localTime": 64,
    "episodeTime": 1109,
    "request": "ep1-bloodmoon-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-bloodmoon-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "大殿深處，王座上的人，終於抬起了頭。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "throne",
    "shotIndex": 1,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 4,
    "episodeTime": 1134,
    "request": "ep1-throne-s01",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-throne-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「四把刀，一個借來的月亮。你們砍斷的每一個誓，都是朕寫的——跪下，朕給你們寫個好一點的。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "throne",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 32,
    "episodeTime": 1162,
    "request": "ep1-throne-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-throne-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「你的墨是別人的血。今夜，墨用完了。現出真身——在月亮落下之前，結束這一切。」"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "throne",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "push",
    "localTime": 56,
    "episodeTime": 1186,
    "request": "ep1-throne-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-throne-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "灰帝起身。血月跟著他起身。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep1",
    "scene": "throne",
    "shotIndex": 4,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 72,
    "episodeTime": 1202,
    "request": "ep1-throne-s04",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep1-throne-s04.png",
    "sourceBeat": "王座之後，是沒有邊的暗。"
  },
  {
