    "scene": "corpse-street",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "push",
    "localTime": 24,
    "episodeTime": 119,
    "request": "ep2-corpse-street-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep2-corpse-street-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "星象是錯的。銅錢上的年號，來自一個他們從未侍奉過的朝代。"
