    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "pan",
    "localTime": 44,
    "episodeTime": 229,
    "request": "ep2-inspectors-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep2-inspectors-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "他們不是惡人——他們是被詔令從各自的書頁裡撕出來的人。"
  },
  {
