    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep2-hall-s01.png",
    "sourceBeat": "穿過大門：一座大如科舉考場的殿。二十張案，列成品字。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep2",
    "scene": "hall",
    "shotIndex": 2,
    "kind": "wide",
    "localTime": 26,
    "episodeTime": 301,
    "request": "ep2-hall-s02",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep2-hall-s02.png",
    "sourceBeat": "二十張臉，同時轉向他們——判官、相國、妃嬪、名妓、名將、名臣。"
  },
  {
    "episode": "ep2",
    "scene": "hall",
    "shotIndex": 3,
    "kind": "closeup",
    "localTime": 48,
    "episodeTime": 323,
    "request": "ep2-hall-s03",
    "output": "assets/animation/shot/ep2-hall-s03.png",
    "sourceBeat": "「閉卷裡的散頁們。詔令把我們集合於此，寫成一個較善的宫廷——也會這樣對你們。跪下，被溫柔地改寫；或者站著，打贏二十人，贏回去的橋。」"
  },
  {
